持ちは再会した今でも変わらず。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃に交わした許婚の約束を胸に秘め、主人公のお嫁さん候補に立候補してくる。彼女は美人というより可愛い感じの女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"育ちのせいか、日本的な物を好む大和撫子だ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ふつつか者ですがお世話になります、お兄様。」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17313","sourceWorkId":"11232","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公・郁の従妹にしてお嫁さん候補。\"和\" を愛するお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃に主人公と出会い、年の離れた彼を兄と慕うようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その気持ちは再会した今でも変わらず、許婚の約束を胸に秘め、主人公のお嫁さん候補として立候補する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美人というより、かわいいといった感じの女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お兄様は私の旦那様です。ふつつか者ですがお世話になります、お兄様」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"143842"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17313","sourceWorkId":"11232","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"156 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17313","sourceWorkId":"11232","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"83 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17313","sourceWorkId":"11232","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"53 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17313","sourceWorkId":"11232","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"47 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17313","sourceWorkId":"11232","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/82/8252510789b402337a5ba9c26caa6dd579768f3d5568c05ea855e2e5199e72d8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/33061a1d27b5823c090d89ad2bddb406e715eec8a969edaaa50ff762b6b6cb74.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中田順子","creatorId":"vndb:s631","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s631","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s631","name":"中田 順子","roleCode":